{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"jfj-e-o043d","title":"姜维谢过自贬后将军","order":7811,"accounts":[{"id":"jfj-a-o043d","label":"正文 · 延熙十九年","text":"姜维谢过自贬后将军","evidence":["jfj-q0164"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0050","role":"自贬","evidence":["jfj-q0164"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"延熙十九年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条保留原时间；未从邻段自动继承公元年。","evidence":["jfj-q0164","jfj-q0022","jfj-q0023"],"year":256,"chronology":"jfj-y256","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"jfj-q0022","basis":"本条行动与所列正文纪年逐项核对；现代注释直接释年。原季月保留，不推公历日。"}},"ordering_evidence":"jfj-q0164"}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0050","name":"姜维","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"jfj-q0022","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-39e4cd8abbef79354a43","layer":"original","quote":"十九年春〖5〗，就迁维为大将军。更整勒戎马，与镇西大将军胡济期会上邽；济失誓不至〖6〗，故维为魏大将邓艾所破于段谷。星散流离，死者甚众，众庶由是怨讟〖7〗；而陇以西亦骚动不宁〖8〗。维谢过引负〖9〗，求自贬削；为后将军，行大将军事。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":196,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0023","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-2eb7f542c1f631821537","layer":"modern","quote":"〖5〗十九年：延熙十九年（公元 256）。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-01fef16b3f2d9d71f5b1","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0164","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-39e4cd8abbef79354a43","layer":"original","quote":"维谢过引负〖9〗，求自贬削；为后将军，行大将军事。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":196,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":91,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode